ed action."}]}]},{"name":"action","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An async closure that the system runs for the specified task","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"type.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the system wakes your app or extension for one or more background","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tasks, it will call any actions associated with matching tasks. When","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your async actions return, the system put your app back into a suspended","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state. The system considers the task completed when the action closure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that you provide returns. If the action closure has not returned when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the task runs out of time to complete, the system cancels the task. Use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Swift\/withTaskCancellationHandler(operation:onCancel:)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to observe whether the task is low on runtime.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/\/ An example of a Weather Application.","struct WeatherApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            Text(\"Responds to App Refresh\")","        }","        .backgroundTask(.appRefresh(\"WEATHER_DATA\")) {","            await updateWeatherData()","        }","    }","    func updateWeatherData() async {","        \/\/ fetches new weather data and updates app state","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene\/backgroundtask(_:action:)-4